-- MAGIC %md-sandbox
-- MAGIC # Storage and Credential Setup
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC This demo provides hands-on experience with Unity Catalog's core storage and governance capabilities. You'll learn to connect external storage systems, and how to apply those connections for use.
-- MAGIC
