-- MAGIC %md-sandbox
-- MAGIC #### A1.1 Requirements
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC Creating a storage credential has the following requirements:
-- MAGIC - Account or metastore admin, or someone with the <code>CREATE STORAGE CREDENTIAL</code> permission on the metastore.
