-- MAGIC       The <code>CREATE STORAGE CREDENTIAL</code> privilege allows non-admin users to create storage credentials. Using this, storage admin responsibilities can be delegated as a separate role if desired (as reflected in the diagram above).
-- MAGIC     </div>
