-- MAGIC %md-sandbox
-- MAGIC #### A2.1 Requirements
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC Creating an external location has the following requirements:
-- MAGIC - Storage credential connecting to an external cloud storage container
-- MAGIC - One of the following:
-- MAGIC    - Account or metastore admin
-- MAGIC    - Ownership of the storage credential
-- MAGIC    - <code>CREATE EXTERNAL LOCATION</code> permission on the metastore or storage credential.
