-- MAGIC %md-sandbox
-- MAGIC ### A3. Validating Connectivity
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC The external location can be inspected through various SQL commands.
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC List all available external locations:
-- MAGIC <div class="code-block" data-language="sql">
-- MAGIC SHOW EXTERNAL LOCATIONS
-- MAGIC </div>
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC Show information regarding a specific location:
-- MAGIC <div class="code-block" data-language="sql">
-- MAGIC DESCRIBE EXTERNAL LOCATION `{external location base name}-dev`
-- MAGIC </div>
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC Also, in the user interface where you created the external location, click the **Test connection** button to validate access.
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC <div style="border-left: 4px solid #1976d2; background: #e3f2fd; padding: 16px 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 16px 0;">
