-- COMMAND ----------

-- MAGIC %md
-- MAGIC ## B. Applications
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC With connections to external storage established, let's explore some important use cases.

-- COMMAND ----------

-- MAGIC %md-sandbox
-- MAGIC ### B1. Physical Data Isolation
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC While Unity Catalog provides logical isolation capabilities out of the box, some organizations may require:
-- MAGIC - Full control of where their data resides, rather than relying on default storage provided by the metastore
-- MAGIC - Physically separating data by catalog (or schema)
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC An example topology is shown below:
-- MAGIC
