-- MAGIC ### B3. DBFS Mount Migration
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC Legacy DBFS mounts provided access to external storage but lacked the governance and security features of Unity Catalog. This section demonstrates how to replace mount-based patterns with Unity Catalog external locations and volumes.

-- COMMAND ----------

-- MAGIC %md-sandbox
-- MAGIC #### B3.1 Identifying Legacy Mount Usage
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC <style>
